WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 14=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.600
(Granted a Marquis Title
While in Prison)

00:42.987 --> 00:45.637
(Cui Mansion)

00:45.675 --> 00:46.279
(Prosperity for Generations)

00:46.279 --> 00:47.380
He is in prison now, right?

00:47.599 --> 00:48.599
Overestimating himself.

00:49.160 --> 00:51.560
He thought being a Lord
made him impressive.

00:51.880 --> 00:52.640
He has no idea

00:52.640 --> 00:54.519
how powerful our great clans are.

00:55.599 --> 00:56.519
This time,

00:56.800 --> 00:59.359
we cannot settle
for just half his shares.

00:59.559 --> 01:00.359
I say

01:00.719 --> 01:01.760
we take eighty percent.

01:02.239 --> 01:04.079
Otherwise, he will not learn his lesson.

01:05.280 --> 01:06.039
By now,

01:06.039 --> 01:08.559
he must have realized
how formidable we are.

01:08.960 --> 01:10.359
(Prosperity for Generations)
Later, we will go to the prison

01:10.399 --> 01:11.920
and give him a hint.

01:12.359 --> 01:14.480
Let him know

01:14.839 --> 01:16.240
this was all our doing.

01:16.399 --> 01:17.399
Of course.

01:17.600 --> 01:19.920
He may not agree now,

01:19.920 --> 01:20.759
but

01:21.200 --> 01:23.280
after a few days behind bars,

01:23.759 --> 01:24.600
I am sure

01:24.600 --> 01:26.240
he will come around.

01:28.640 --> 01:29.159
Good.

01:29.359 --> 01:31.520
Let us go to the prison now
and ask Wei Hao

01:31.719 --> 01:33.200
if he has thought it through.

01:33.320 --> 01:33.840
Let's go.

01:34.280 --> 01:35.280
Go.

01:35.280 --> 01:38.837
(Prosperity for Generations)

01:39.079 --> 01:40.200
People from the great clans?

01:41.640 --> 01:42.600
Tell them to get lost.

01:43.719 --> 01:45.119
I am sleepy right now.

01:45.439 --> 01:46.759
If they keep bothering me,

01:46.759 --> 01:48.319
I will go out and deal with them myself.

01:48.920 --> 01:49.519
Go.

01:50.040 --> 01:51.599
Repeat exactly what I said.

01:52.040 --> 01:52.840
What?

01:53.239 --> 01:54.200
Deal with us?

01:55.400 --> 01:56.959
This Wei the Fool

01:57.319 --> 01:59.040
is truly full of himself.

01:59.239 --> 02:01.519
Looks like he is furious
after what we did to him.

02:01.599 --> 02:02.439
Exactly.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.280
Fine.

02:04.079 --> 02:06.319
I will not stoop
to the level of a prisoner!

02:09.680 --> 02:10.920
If he will not see us, so be it.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.879
I will come back in a few days.

02:13.480 --> 02:15.280
By then, he will be begging us.

02:19.879 --> 02:21.200
These people

02:21.359 --> 02:22.959
have gone too far.

02:23.359 --> 02:26.319
The Wei clan finally produced a Lord,

02:26.439 --> 02:28.519
and they suppressed him like this.

02:28.920 --> 02:29.760
Indeed.

02:32.120 --> 02:33.879
From this incident,

02:34.120 --> 02:36.239
I have come to see clearly.

02:37.000 --> 02:38.239
Though Wei Hao

02:38.439 --> 02:40.480
is somewhat hot-tempered,

02:40.680 --> 02:42.560
he is still a decent man.

02:43.319 --> 02:45.400
He is reasonable.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.239
Besides,

02:47.319 --> 02:49.560
he is from the Wei clan.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.680
Whatever the issue,

02:53.280 --> 02:56.240
it is not for outsiders
to discipline him.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.159
Clan Leader,

02:57.479 --> 02:58.400
how should

02:58.520 --> 02:59.800
we handle this?

03:00.680 --> 03:02.599
Inform Wei Ting
at the Central Secretariat.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.879
Have the members of our clan

03:04.879 --> 03:07.080
also impeach officials from their clans.

03:07.199 --> 03:08.080
Choose those

03:08.120 --> 03:10.120
in key positions.

03:10.520 --> 03:12.039
One from each clan.

03:12.520 --> 03:15.000
If they want to stir trouble,

03:15.000 --> 03:17.800
the Wei clan is not to be trifled with.

03:17.840 --> 03:18.639
Understood.

03:25.960 --> 03:29.039
These are the impeachment memorials submitted
by the Wei clan officials.

03:29.360 --> 03:31.560
Investigate each one carefully.

03:32.719 --> 03:33.520
Yes.

03:33.960 --> 03:36.960
(The moment the Wei clan impeached,
His Majesty began investigating.)

03:37.280 --> 03:39.120
(He is even reviewing earlier cases,)

03:39.120 --> 03:40.670
(the officials who impeached Wei Hao.)

03:40.719 --> 03:42.080
(His Majesty is...)

03:45.800 --> 03:46.599
Hurry.

03:47.280 --> 03:47.840
Move.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.039
Quickly.

04:01.680 --> 04:03.759
Lord, what is going on
with those people?

04:04.639 --> 04:06.479
They were all impeached by the Wei clan.

04:06.800 --> 04:09.240
This time, quite a number of officials
have been removed.

04:09.879 --> 04:10.680
About

04:10.840 --> 04:12.000
a dozen or so.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.680
All are officials
of the fifth rank and above.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.439
What a waste.

04:16.439 --> 04:17.719
Impeached by the Wei clan?

04:18.080 --> 04:18.879
Yes.

04:25.159 --> 04:26.439
Impeached by the Wei clan?

04:28.500 --> 04:30.790
(Isn't Father-in-law the one
who intended to deal with them?)

04:30.800 --> 04:32.980
(Why did it turn into
the Wei clan impeaching them?)

04:33.719 --> 04:34.800
(Could it be...)

04:36.400 --> 04:38.400
(Could it be Father-in-law
used my position)

04:38.400 --> 04:39.990
(to stir conflict
among the great clans,)

04:40.319 --> 04:41.719
(using the Wei clan)

04:41.719 --> 04:43.520
(to weaken their power?)

04:46.080 --> 04:47.080
A clever move.

04:52.199 --> 04:53.000
What?

04:53.319 --> 04:54.759
All of them were arrested?

04:55.319 --> 04:56.560
Yes.

04:56.919 --> 04:59.519
This time, these clans
have all suffered losses.

04:59.800 --> 05:00.600
Clan Leader,

05:00.680 --> 05:02.519
will this not cause conflict

05:02.519 --> 05:04.279
between our clan and the others?

05:05.000 --> 05:07.240
How could it?

05:07.560 --> 05:09.120
Impeachment is just impeachment.

05:09.279 --> 05:11.639
When has it ever succeeded before?

05:12.199 --> 05:13.399
We only hoped

05:13.519 --> 05:16.040
to bring down one or two.

05:16.120 --> 05:18.480
How did it become all of them?

05:20.000 --> 05:20.399
You...

05:20.399 --> 05:21.720
Clan Leader!

05:21.839 --> 05:22.439
You...

05:23.360 --> 05:24.199
Clan Leader Wei.

05:25.319 --> 05:26.199
Clan Leader Wei.

05:26.200 --> 05:27.720
What is the meaning of this
from the Wei clan?

05:27.720 --> 05:29.480
You brought down
so many of our officials at once.

05:29.480 --> 05:30.820
What exactly are you trying to do?

05:31.160 --> 05:32.519
What do you mean?

05:32.800 --> 05:35.560
You are allowed
to arrest Wei Hao from our clan,

05:35.839 --> 05:36.879
but we are not allowed

05:36.879 --> 05:39.279
to impeach officials from your clans?

05:39.519 --> 05:43.079
Even so, you should not have taken down
so many at once.

05:43.639 --> 05:44.519
Is it a lot?

05:47.040 --> 05:48.759
Who is Wei Hao?

05:49.319 --> 05:52.639
He is the only Lord in the Wei clan.

05:53.000 --> 05:55.399
Those officials who were arrested,

05:55.879 --> 05:59.000
can they even compare to Wei Hao?

05:59.439 --> 06:00.639
So what if he is a Lord?

06:01.279 --> 06:03.680
It was the Wei clan
that broke the rules.

06:03.680 --> 06:05.519
Are we not allowed to deal with it?

06:06.000 --> 06:06.800
Everyone,

06:07.160 --> 06:08.360
we did not expect

06:08.399 --> 06:10.879
the impeachment to turn out like this.

06:10.959 --> 06:11.920
Normally,

06:12.160 --> 06:13.399
such accusations

06:13.600 --> 06:16.120
would not land
so many officials in prison.

06:17.079 --> 06:18.000
I believe

06:18.279 --> 06:19.759
there must be something behind this

06:19.759 --> 06:21.480
that we do not know.

06:21.839 --> 06:25.160
Did you perhaps anger His Majesty?

06:26.240 --> 06:28.439
(Based on the Wei clan alone,)

06:29.000 --> 06:31.290
(it would not be possible
to bring down so many officials.)

06:32.199 --> 06:34.720
(Could it be
that another force intervened?)

06:36.439 --> 06:37.240
Everyone,

06:37.759 --> 06:38.600
you have

06:38.720 --> 06:41.279
come to the Wei clan to demand answers,

06:41.279 --> 06:42.700
but you are asking the wrong people.

06:42.800 --> 06:43.759
Let's set aside

06:44.079 --> 06:45.800
whether we even have the ability

06:45.800 --> 06:47.439
to bring down so many officials.

06:47.720 --> 06:51.040
Just think about it.
You had Wei Hao thrown into prison.

06:51.600 --> 06:53.680
Wei Hao is impulsive.

06:53.879 --> 06:54.920
By doing this,

06:54.920 --> 06:56.759
you will only make things worse.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.839
Just wait and see.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.480
Once Wei Hao comes out,

07:01.639 --> 07:04.480
if you can still get glaze from him,

07:04.920 --> 07:07.480
then you have some ability.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.079
He does not agree,

07:13.800 --> 07:15.360
and he thinks he can just walk out?

07:15.639 --> 07:19.600
Then I would like to see that.

07:31.079 --> 07:33.279
If he still does not know his place,

07:33.279 --> 07:35.199
we will impeach
a few more of his people.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.560
That is enough.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.120
That

07:43.120 --> 07:44.079
is done?

07:45.210 --> 07:46.519
What is so complicated about it?

07:51.079 --> 07:53.000
This really is pure white salt.

07:53.639 --> 07:54.839
So fine.

07:55.330 --> 07:57.399
This one batch alone must
be seventy to eighty jin.

07:57.399 --> 07:59.519
And it only took about two hours.

08:00.319 --> 08:01.519
That is incredibly fast.

08:03.279 --> 08:04.959
When you scale this up,

08:05.519 --> 08:06.759
use more pots.

08:07.079 --> 08:08.040
Start with a strong fire,

08:08.040 --> 08:10.199
then switch to a low heat
to produce the salt.

08:14.000 --> 08:14.560
Alright.

08:14.720 --> 08:15.959
Just follow my method.

08:16.279 --> 08:17.370
If there are any problems,

08:17.480 --> 08:18.800
come to me anytime.

08:19.639 --> 08:22.360
I will report back
to His Majesty at once.

08:23.000 --> 08:24.199
Many thanks, Lord Wei.

08:24.199 --> 08:24.959
Thank you.

08:25.199 --> 08:26.240
Think nothing of it.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.439
This is for the people,

08:31.639 --> 08:33.800
after all.

08:38.800 --> 08:40.199
Can something this fine

08:40.759 --> 08:41.800
really be salt?

08:43.240 --> 08:44.279
Of course.

08:44.560 --> 08:46.560
Wei the Fool taught me how to make it.

08:46.920 --> 08:48.360
It was Wei Hao again.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.839
This fine white salt

08:49.839 --> 08:51.040
is far superior

08:51.040 --> 08:52.480
to the official salt we have.

08:52.480 --> 08:54.600
And the Ministry of Works
has already verified it.

08:54.959 --> 08:56.639
It is safe to consume

08:56.639 --> 08:57.439
and not toxic.

09:00.319 --> 09:01.120
Remarkable.

09:01.560 --> 09:03.319
Such fine salt is exceptional.

09:03.800 --> 09:06.439
Then, what about its production?

09:06.759 --> 09:07.600
Your Majesty,

09:07.959 --> 09:09.120
Wei the Fool said

09:09.240 --> 09:10.720
that as long as there is enough brine

09:10.720 --> 09:11.920
and enough pots,

09:12.480 --> 09:15.120
it can produce at least four
to five hundred jin a day.

09:15.240 --> 09:17.000
If there are twenty such pots,

09:17.000 --> 09:19.360
the daily output could reach
over ten thousand jin.

09:21.600 --> 09:22.480
That much?

09:23.000 --> 09:24.190
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

09:24.320 --> 09:27.120
If what Minister Duan said is true,

09:27.840 --> 09:30.039
then Wei Hao, with salt alone,

09:30.039 --> 09:31.799
could bring in

09:31.799 --> 09:33.720
over a million guan
in profit for the court.

09:34.399 --> 09:36.279
This year's deficit
in the Ministry of Revenue

09:36.279 --> 09:37.600
can be covered.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.519
If production reaches that scale,

09:42.720 --> 09:45.120
then it cannot be sold
at the current price.

09:45.130 --> 09:46.960
Salt is not easy
for common people to obtain.

09:47.399 --> 09:49.200
Ordinary families
are reluctant to buy it.

09:49.639 --> 09:50.799
The price must be lowered.

09:50.799 --> 09:51.559
We cannot

09:51.559 --> 09:54.159
use this to profit from the people.

09:54.759 --> 09:56.639
When the time comes,
the Ministry of Revenue

09:57.120 --> 09:58.639
will discuss measures

09:58.759 --> 10:00.080
to regulate the price.

10:01.110 --> 10:03.110
- Wise decision, Your Majesty.
- Wise decision, Your Majesty.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.279
Wei Hao

10:04.559 --> 10:07.399
has rendered great service
to the Great Yong.

10:08.320 --> 10:10.679
He should be well rewarded.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.720
What do you all suggest?

10:13.360 --> 10:14.039
Your Majesty,

10:14.240 --> 10:15.879
judging by such merit,

10:15.879 --> 10:17.960
even granting him a dukedom
would be justified.

10:18.679 --> 10:19.679
At present,

10:19.679 --> 10:22.080
our frontline soldiers
cannot even get coarse salt.

10:22.279 --> 10:25.159
Wei Hao has solved the problem
of salt for the troops.

10:25.759 --> 10:26.559
Your Majesty,

10:26.600 --> 10:27.840
I do not agree.

10:28.600 --> 10:29.360
I have heard

10:29.360 --> 10:31.559
that this Wei Hao is notorious,

10:31.639 --> 10:32.879
arrogant, and ill-mannered.

10:32.879 --> 10:34.600
He is hardly fit for court service.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.000
Indeed,

10:37.519 --> 10:39.200
his contribution with salt

10:39.480 --> 10:40.480
has brought

10:40.879 --> 10:42.279
great merit to the court.

10:42.720 --> 10:45.679
But to grant him a dukedom
on that basis alone

10:46.000 --> 10:48.639
may stir dissatisfaction
among other meritorious officials.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.000
The current dukes

10:50.279 --> 10:52.159
have all lived through turbulent times,

10:52.160 --> 10:53.710
with distinguished
military achievements,

10:53.720 --> 10:55.120
and have rendered great service

10:55.120 --> 10:56.879
in founding the Great Yong.

10:57.120 --> 10:59.519
Yet Wei Hao, an uncrowned youth,

10:59.919 --> 11:01.559
would be granted a dukedom

11:01.559 --> 11:03.039
based solely on salt?

11:03.320 --> 11:06.000
Would that not dishearten
the veteran generals?

11:06.080 --> 11:08.120
Minister Zhangsun,
that is not quite right.

11:08.320 --> 11:11.039
Everyone here knows

11:11.360 --> 11:13.080
how vital salt is to the Great Yong.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.879
With such a great contribution,

11:14.879 --> 11:15.960
granting him a dukedom

11:16.200 --> 11:19.200
would not draw objections
from other officials.

11:19.200 --> 11:20.039
Exactly.

11:20.039 --> 11:21.279
Though Wei Hao is young,

11:21.279 --> 11:22.200
and he has indeed

11:22.200 --> 11:24.120
done some reckless things before,

11:24.279 --> 11:26.000
he is simply a fool

11:26.000 --> 11:27.080
and still young.

11:27.080 --> 11:29.200
Acting impulsively is understandable.

11:29.519 --> 11:31.159
Now, speaking strictly of this matter,

11:31.399 --> 11:33.759
with this one achievement in salt,

11:34.220 --> 11:36.200
not only did he solve
the people's need for salt,

11:36.600 --> 11:38.639
but he also brought
new revenue to the court,

11:38.750 --> 11:40.559
making up for the Ministry
of Revenue's deficit.

11:41.159 --> 11:42.279
And this source of income

11:42.279 --> 11:44.360
will continue year after year.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.159
One could say

11:45.159 --> 11:47.320
it is worth countless guan.

11:47.639 --> 11:49.320
He deserves to be made a duke.

11:49.320 --> 11:49.879
That is right,

11:49.879 --> 11:50.679
Your Majesty,

11:50.720 --> 11:52.440
I still do not agree.

11:52.679 --> 11:55.039
Granting a dukedom at such a young age,

11:55.320 --> 11:56.120
who knows

11:56.159 --> 11:58.159
how arrogant he will become later?

11:58.159 --> 12:00.559
(This boy truly speaks
without thinking.)

12:00.720 --> 12:02.679
(So young,
yet placed in such a high position,)

12:02.679 --> 12:04.080
(he will surely invite resentment.)

12:04.159 --> 12:05.039
A dukedom will not do.

12:05.039 --> 12:05.840
Enough.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.039
How about this?

12:07.879 --> 12:08.919
The lad

12:09.039 --> 12:11.000
does tend to cause trouble.

12:11.919 --> 12:14.320
Grant him a marquis title instead.

12:15.320 --> 12:17.120
Would that be too light?

12:17.120 --> 12:17.720
Yes.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.759
Let us settle it this way.

12:19.480 --> 12:22.000
Have the Department of State Affairs
draft the decree.

12:22.000 --> 12:24.160
This afternoon, go to Wei Hao's
mansion to deliver it.

12:24.399 --> 12:25.200
Your Majesty,

12:25.759 --> 12:27.919
Wei Hao is still in prison.

12:28.279 --> 12:30.320
Should he be released?

12:31.399 --> 12:32.320
Not yet.

12:32.360 --> 12:33.480
Let him remain there for now.

12:36.080 --> 12:39.000
(Wei Mansion)
By the Mandate of Heaven and the Emperor decrees,

12:39.519 --> 12:41.080
salt is the lifeblood of the state,

12:41.080 --> 12:42.840
yet it has long faced obstacles.

12:42.879 --> 12:44.639
This has weighed on my mind.

12:44.679 --> 12:46.399
Wei Hao is gifted and perceptive,

12:46.399 --> 12:47.679
with the state at heart.

12:48.000 --> 12:49.200
In the art of salt production,

12:49.200 --> 12:50.399
he has forged a new path.

12:50.879 --> 12:53.080
In recognition of his outstanding merit,

12:53.080 --> 12:54.540
I hereby confer
upon Wei Hao the title of

12:54.559 --> 12:56.960
Dynasty-Founding Marquis Pingyang.

12:57.039 --> 12:57.960
(Marquis.)

12:58.320 --> 12:59.960
By imperial decree.

13:01.260 --> 13:03.759
On Wei Hao's behalf, I thank
His Majesty for this great grace.

13:07.120 --> 13:09.000
Congratulations.

13:09.039 --> 13:09.840
Eunuch,

13:10.120 --> 13:12.320
Hao is still in prison.

13:12.320 --> 13:14.320
Could there be a mistake?

13:14.840 --> 13:16.320
There is no mistake.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.000
This is His Majesty's personal decree,

13:18.000 --> 13:20.240
decided upon in court.

13:20.519 --> 13:22.080
You may rest assured.

13:22.440 --> 13:23.320
Also,

13:23.639 --> 13:25.240
His Majesty has instructed

13:25.320 --> 13:26.120
that Wei Hao...

13:26.279 --> 13:26.720
No,

13:26.720 --> 13:27.559
the Marquis.

13:27.639 --> 13:29.360
There's a reason

13:29.360 --> 13:30.840
Marquis remains in prison.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.159
You need not worry.

13:33.120 --> 13:33.919
Understood.

13:34.639 --> 13:36.000
If there is nothing further,

13:36.279 --> 13:37.960
I shall take my leave.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.110
We respectfully see you off.

13:49.679 --> 13:50.720
Marquis, Marquis!

13:50.879 --> 13:52.759
Hao may not know yet.

13:53.639 --> 13:54.399
Mister Wang,

13:54.639 --> 13:56.320
prepare some good food

13:56.320 --> 13:57.360
and some celebratory gifts.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.279
I am going to
the Ministry of Justice Prison

13:58.279 --> 13:59.639
to tell Hao the good news.

14:00.279 --> 14:00.879
Yes.

14:01.279 --> 14:02.559
I will go myself.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.440
Am I dreaming?

14:04.440 --> 14:06.440
Our mansion is now a marquis's estate?

14:07.440 --> 14:09.990
The fool must have stumbled into
some incredible stroke of luck.

14:17.737 --> 14:20.567
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

14:21.187 --> 14:24.587
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:25.357 --> 14:28.307
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:28.647 --> 14:31.347
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:32.947 --> 14:36.417
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:36.417 --> 14:38.647
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:38.647 --> 14:40.757
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:40.757 --> 14:42.777
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:42.777 --> 14:47.137
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:48.577 --> 14:52.307
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:52.577 --> 14:56.177
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:56.337 --> 14:58.417
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:58.417 --> 15:03.207
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

15:03.427 --> 15:05.047
♪The world mistakes me♪

15:05.047 --> 15:07.387
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

15:07.457 --> 15:08.647
♪As the storm approaches♪

15:08.647 --> 15:11.047
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

15:11.257 --> 15:12.977
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

15:12.977 --> 15:14.957
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

15:15.127 --> 15:16.877
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

15:16.877 --> 15:18.977
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

15:18.977 --> 15:20.447
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

15:20.447 --> 15:22.677
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

15:22.897 --> 15:24.097
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

15:24.097 --> 15:26.617
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:26.747 --> 15:28.457
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:28.457 --> 15:29.737
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:29.887 --> 15:31.307
♪My wish has finally come true:♪

15:31.307 --> 15:32.347
♪To stay by your side♪

15:32.347 --> 15:34.267
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:34.437 --> 15:37.687
♪We are free and happy♪

15:41.687 --> 15:43.467
♪From a nobody♪

15:43.467 --> 15:45.367
♪To someone now famous♪

15:45.477 --> 15:46.907
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:46.907 --> 15:49.417
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

15:49.517 --> 15:51.097
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:51.097 --> 15:53.167
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:53.377 --> 15:55.057
♪In this vast world♪

15:55.057 --> 15:57.057
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:57.207 --> 15:59.417
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:59.417 --> 16:01.007
♪Everything ends eventually♪

16:01.097 --> 16:02.597
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

16:02.597 --> 16:04.997
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

16:04.997 --> 16:06.707
♪No matter how time flies♪

16:06.707 --> 16:07.867
♪Even if the falling snow♪

16:07.867 --> 16:09.497
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

16:09.497 --> 16:10.537
♪All I want now♪

16:10.537 --> 16:12.637
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

16:12.637 --> 16:15.897
♪Year after year♪
